---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Editor">
<main class="wrap ed">
  <div class="kicker">Editor</div>
  <header class="profile">
    <img src="/img/editor.jpg?v=3" alt="Abhinav Roy" width="240" height="240">
    <div>
      <h1>Abhinav Roy</h1>
      <p class="lede">Editor of EPBM Library. He wrote these notes while studying in the Executive Programme in Business Management at IIM Calcutta (EPBM-32), and works as an OT/ICS security leader.</p>
      <p class="links"><a class="btn" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/abhinavroy07/">LinkedIn</a><a class="btn" href="https://x.com/fiasco_07">X</a><a class="btn" href="mailto:abhinav@girder.in">Email</a></p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="prose">
    <p>Abhinav took notes in every session of the programme, wrote them up the same week for his batchmates, and at the end of each subject merged them into one set of master notes. EPBM Library is those master notes, rebuilt so they are easier to read and to learn from.</p>

    <h2>How the notes are made</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>From the classroom, in order.</strong> Each book follows the sessions as they were taught, with the stories, examples and worked numbers used in class.</li>
      <li><strong>Plain English first.</strong> Every idea is explained in everyday words before the framework or formula appears.</li>
      <li><strong>Learn by doing.</strong> Calculators, decision cards and sorting exercises sit inside the chapters, and every subject ends with practice questions.</li>
      <li><strong>Yours to keep.</strong> Each subject's master notes can also be downloaded as a PDF.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>About Abhinav</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Based in Bangalore, India.</li>
      <li>Ten years in cybersecurity, the last four in industrial (OT/ICS) security.</li>
      <li>Leads global managed security services for industrial customers in energy, manufacturing and utilities.</li>
      <li>Also edits <a href="https://brief.girder.in/">Industrial Cyber Brief</a>, a daily briefing on industrial cybersecurity.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Talks and recognition</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Speaker (upcoming): Cyber AI Risk Summit, Kuala Lumpur, January 2027</li>
      <li>Podcast guest: “OT security and AI”, Prabh Nair's cybersecurity podcast, 2026</li>
      <li>Panellist: “AI Meets OT”, c0c0n 2026, Kochi</li>
      <li>Panellist: “Governing the Algorithm: AI and the Future of Work in India”, Observer Research Foundation, 2026</li>
      <li>Enterprise Security Champion, The Economic Times Enterprise Security Awards 2026</li>
      <li>Security Transformation Leader of the Year, Future Tech Summit &amp; Awards 2026</li>
      <li>c0c0n Speaker Award, c0c0n 2026</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Get in touch</h2>
    <p>Spotted a mistake, or want a topic explained better? Email <a href="mailto:abhinav@girder.in">abhinav@girder.in</a> or message on <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/abhinavroy07/">LinkedIn</a>.</p>

    <div class="callout">
      <p class="callout-title">Please note</p>
      <p>EPBM Library is an independent, student-run project. It is not affiliated with, reviewed by, or speaking for IIM Calcutta, its faculty, or any employer. The notes are a personal study aid and may contain mistakes, so check anything important against your own course material. Case studies, slides and readings belong to their publishers and are not hosted here.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>

<style>
.ed{max-width:860px;padding-top:48px}
.kicker{font:600 15px var(--sans);color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:18px}
.profile{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:40px;padding-bottom:36px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);margin-bottom:32px}
.profile img{flex:none;width:240px;height:240px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;background:var(--surface)}
h1{margin:0;font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(36px,5vw,52px);line-height:1.1}
.lede{margin:14px 0 0;font:18px/1.6 var(--sans);color:var(--muted)}
.links{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin:20px 0 0}
.btn{font:600 15px var(--sans);color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none;padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:var(--surface)}
.btn:hover{border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent)}
@media (max-width:640px){.profile{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:24px}.profile img{width:200px;height:200px}}
</style>
</Base>
